/*
  FormatterPrefsBridge.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0146 · FormatterPrefsBridge (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The web source
  (components/FormatterPrefsBridge.tsx) renders `null` and routes NO copy through `t()` — it is a
  side-effect-only bridge. Under the P4 leaf "never a blank box" contract the native surface renders a
  compact diagnostic of the formatter prefs it syncs, so every string below is native P4 leaf chrome
  (the applied card, the device-defaults state, the unavailable retry, the connectivity chip, and the
  VoiceOver labels). These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table ("FormatterPrefsBridge") so each parallel
  surface prompt owns its strings. Native code holds no hardcoded English — every literal here is the
  resolver fallback.
*/

/* --- Applied card (active formatter prefs) --- */
"settings.formatter.title" = "Formatting preferences";
